      "date": "2026-11-24 09:27:32.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1: Verified+1\n\nCopied votes on follow-up patch sets have been updated:\n* Verified+1 has been copied to patch set 2 (copy condition: \"changekind:NO_CHANGE OR changekind:NO_CODE_CHANGE\").\n\nPassed enforced test review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on RHEL 8.10 / x86_64, Rocky 9.8 / aarch64 uploaded by Onyx Autotest 2 from onyx-154vm26: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/20fbcd49-d2d2-489d-83cc-00e2ae94c865 ran 5 tests.",
