        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Andreas Dilger",
          "email": "adilger@thelustrecollective.com",
          "date": "2026-11-23 22:00:00.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-21298 tests: skip sanity-pcc/204a-c for old servers",
        "message": "LU-21298 tests: skip sanity-pcc/204a-c for old servers\n\nsanity-pcc test_204a, test_204b and test_204c would fail with a\nmaster client and 2.16 servers, because \"lfs pcc pin\" sets the\nvirtual lustre.pin xattr, which only MDTs with the enable_pin_gid\npatch map to trusted.pin.  Older MDTs return -EOPNOTSUPP.\n\nRaise the MDS version check in these subtests from 2.15.61 to the\ncommit that added lustre.pin handling to the MDT.\n\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity-pcc serverversion=2.16 env=ONLY=204,HONOR_EXCEPT=y\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-pcc\nFixes: 84100d7f7d38 (\"LU-10499 pcc: tunable GID to pin/unpin files\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I1c5783a8a2abbaf0dc36d1dd9753c09b0c3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
